    <string name="settings_tutorial_title">Tutorial</string>
    <string name="settings_tutorial_message">Go over how SegundoAire works in five cards.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_card_what">SegundoAire steps in for a moment when you open an app you chose, so you can decide calmly.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_card_glasswall">The GlassWall is a pane of glass over the app. You breathe with it, then choose to go back or continue.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_card_rigor">Mindful lets you continue after 10 seconds. Strict keeps you out until the block ends.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_card_blocks">A block is a stretch of focus, from 5 to 30 minutes. While it lasts, the strictness you picked rules.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_card_progress">In Progress you see the minutes you recover, the openings you avoid and your streak.</string>
